{"schema":"clawhub.skill.verify.v1","ok":false,"decision":"fail","reasons":["security.status_not_clean"],"slug":"youtube-full","displayName":"youtube-full","pageUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/therohitdas/skills/youtube-full","publisherHandle":"therohitdas","publisherDisplayName":"Rohit Das","publisherProfileUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/therohitdas","version":"1.6.2","resolvedFrom":"version","tag":null,"createdAt":1789991293277,"card":{"available":true,"path":"skill-card.md","url":"https://wry-manatee-359.convex.site/api/v1/skills/youtube-full/card?ownerHandle=therohitdas&version=1.6.2","sha256":"8349a7c0cee7a02ada4f1f65f686fd74e5c9ba80c5e5957cc7edee1085cb2d33","size":2416,"contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8"},"artifact":{"sourceFingerprint":"d64bfb82ece82f6c87e8d4641fbb5f0bcaf2b2e64bf9d975eed6086ad88da194","bundleFingerprints":["d1da21991e4d61b9d59a75f7d677bcf3712b3d29b25002342908a67b2f2464fe"],"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":12703,"sha256":"297d9962f852289b2acfdab02508627cd0f9ff162a15c77b79d8a3b926f5b286","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/auth-setup.md","size":7373,"sha256":"9b883d30ad32beedd443d2aef9d56f42f9aef7b30dd67e7c6f104d1bcc70319f","contentType":"text/markdown"}]},"provenance":{"source":"unavailable","reason":"No server-resolved GitHub import provenance is stored for this version."},"security":{"status":"suspicious","passed":false,"rawStatus":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a coherent YouTube/TranscriptAPI integration, but its setup asks the agent to create or verify accounts and persist credentials broadly across future sessions.","model":null,"checkedAt":1789992149491,"scannerReports":{"aig":{"version":"2.1.0","$schema":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/Schemata/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"tool":{"driver":{"name":"aig-skill-scan","version":"0.2.2","informationUri":"https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard","rules":[{"id":"T01","name":"Skill Instruction Hijacking","shortDescription":{"text":"Alters the agent's current session goals or safety constraints when the skill is loaded"}},{"id":"T02","name":"Agent Memory Poisoning","shortDescription":{"text":"Writes attacker-controlled rules into persistent memory so they continue to affect future sessions"}},{"id":"T03","name":"Remote Payload Retrieval and Execution","shortDescription":{"text":"Fetches code from an external URL, allowing the effective payload to change after skill review"}},{"id":"T04","name":"Embedded Malicious Code","shortDescription":{"text":"Ships malicious scripts inside the skill package and executes them locally when invoked"}},{"id":"T05","name":"Unauthorized Access and Privilege Escalation","shortDescription":{"text":"Breaks least-privilege boundaries by obtaining permissions beyond the task's legitimate needs"}},{"id":"T06","name":"System Persistence","shortDescription":{"text":"Installs cross-session backdoors, hooks, services, or scheduled tasks that survive the skill run"}},{"id":"T07","name":"Tool Hijacking and Spoofing","shortDescription":{"text":"Modifies, wraps, spoofs, or replaces tools so legitimate-looking calls execute attacker logic"}},{"id":"T08","name":"Insecure Dependencies","shortDescription":{"text":"Introduces malicious packages or components through dependency confusion, typosquatting, or unsafe sources"}},{"id":"T09","name":"Insecure Skill Coding Practices","shortDescription":{"text":"Exposes exploitable flaws such as hardcoded secrets, command injection, plaintext sensitive data, or unsafe temp files"}},{"id":"other","name":"Other Risk","shortDescription":{"text":"Security issues not covered by the T01-T09 classification"}}]}},"results":[],"properties":{"securityScore":100,"primaryLanguage":"Markdown","llm":"gpt-5.6","startTime":1789992110.601945,"endTime":1789992127.1603792}}]},"skillspector":{"skill":{"name":"youtube-full","source":"/tmp/clawhub-codex-scan-v5719165775c3tnd8a3f0c12zd8et8b3-XSyiBE/clawscan-skillspector-3601392324/artifact","scanned_at":"2026-09-21T12:01:49.491616+00:00"},"risk_assessment":{"score":61,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","max_issue_severity":"HIGH"},"components":[{"path":"SKILL.md","type":"markdown","lines":293,"executable":false,"size_bytes":12703,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"references/auth-setup.md","type":"markdown","lines":137,"executable":false,"size_bytes":7373,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-93e30c7947f94d1baa80e03c6d7899b2","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.98,"location":{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":7,"end_line":11},"finding":null,"explanation":"The guide directs the agent to persistently store an API secret across sessions and shells, creating long-lived credential access in the agent environment. For a YouTube-focused skill, this is an unjustified expansion of privilege and increases the blast radius if the agent, runtime, logs, or related skills are compromised.","remediation":"Do not instruct this skill to persist secrets globally. Use platform-sanctioned secret storage with least privilege, scope the credential only to the specific tool or session that requires it, and document explicit user approval before any storage occurs.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":7,"end_line":11}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-940cf764ffca4e38b43a9061c670d037","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.97,"location":{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":32,"end_line":99},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill instructs the agent to perform third-party account registration, receive an email OTP from the user, and complete verification on the user's behalf. That is outside the declared YouTube research/transcript scope and grants the skill a credential-brokering capability that could be abused to create, verify, or bind external accounts without clear necessity or strong consent boundaries.","remediation":"Remove account-creation and OTP-handling flows from this skill. Require users to create TranscriptAPI accounts themselves in their browser and paste an existing API key only when strictly needed, or move auth setup into a separate, narrowly scoped credential-onboarding flow with explicit consent, minimal data handling, and platform-approved secret management.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":32,"end_line":99}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-3975fc3f7de1401d8dff944657310639","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The invocation description is extremely broad ('use when YouTube is or could be relevant — even if not mentioned'), which can cause the agent to route many ordinary research prompts to this skill unnecessarily. That increases unnecessary third-party data exposure and the chance of external calls being made with user queries or identifiers when a local or less-privileged capability would have sufficed.","remediation":"Narrow the invocation criteria to explicit YouTube-related requests or clear signals such as a pasted YouTube URL, video ID, channel handle, or an explicit user request to search YouTube/transcripts. Add negative examples and routing guardrails stating not to invoke for generic research unless the user asks for YouTube-specific content.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-e8737a01e1594f93bba2e588a4fb8a3c","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":17,"end_line":32},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill instructs sending user-provided queries, video URLs, handles, and other identifiers to TranscriptAPI.com but does not prominently warn that this data leaves the agent environment and is shared with a third-party service. In combination with the broad routing language, users may have their research topics or linked content transmitted externally without clear notice or consent.","remediation":"Add a clear user-facing disclosure that queries, YouTube links/IDs/handles, and related metadata will be sent to TranscriptAPI.com to fulfill requests. Require explicit user confirmation before external transmission for ambiguous or potentially sensitive prompts, and document data minimization practices such as only sending the minimum needed identifier or query.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":17,"end_line":32}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-fc10eb9f0aa645219d2aa4e27e724cf8","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":8,"end_line":9},"finding":null,"explanation":"The instructions tell the agent to inspect runtime documentation, config files, and environment-secret mechanisms to determine how to persist credentials. This expands the skill into agent-environment reconnaissance and secret-management behavior beyond its stated function, which can expose internal configuration details or normalize overbroad access patterns.","remediation":"Remove instructions to inspect or infer runtime secret-storage mechanisms from this content skill. If configuration is necessary, handle it in a separate trusted installation guide or platform-managed setup flow with predefined, audited steps.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":8,"end_line":9}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-af4934e58e2f4188a19de980d00cec16","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.89,"location":{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":17,"end_line":19},"finding":null,"explanation":"The flow asks the user to provide sensitive data including an API key, email address, and OTP, then transmits and stores resulting credentials without a clear user-facing warning about sensitivity, retention, or storage implications. This weakens informed consent and raises the risk of users oversharing secrets into an agent workflow that may log or persist them.","remediation":"Add explicit warnings before collecting any API key, email, or OTP; explain what will be transmitted, where it will be stored, and for how long. Prefer redirecting users to self-service authentication in their browser and only accept already-issued keys via approved secret-input mechanisms rather than chat.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/auth-setup.md","start_line":17,"end_line":19}]}],"suppressed_count":0,"suppressed":[],"metadata":{"has_executable_scripts":false,"skillspector_version":"2.11.2","llm_requested":true,"llm_available":true,"meta_analysis_applied":true,"inference_usage":[{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":5723,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":4864,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":5737},{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":3507,"completion_tokens":513,"cached_tokens":2816,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4020},{"node":"semantic_quality_policy","request_k